## 3. Typography

**Nothing below 12px on mobile, ever.**

| Role | Mobile | Desktop | Class | Weight |
|------|--------|---------|-------|--------|
| Page heading | 20px | 18px | `text-heading` | `font-bold` |
| Card/section title | 16px | 14px | `text-subheading` | `font-semibold` |
| Body / primary text | 16px | 14px | `text-body` | `font-medium` |
| Secondary text | 14px | 12px | `text-secondary` | `font-normal` |
| Button text | 14px | 12px | `text-button` | `font-medium` |
| Labels / captions | 12px | 10px | `text-label` | `font-medium` |
| Badges / status | 12px | 10px | `text-label` | `font-semibold` |

### Rules

- Body text: **16px minimum** on mobile — prevents iOS auto-zoom on inputs
- Line height: **1.5** for body, **1.2** for headings
- Truncate long text with `truncate`, never shrink font below the floor
- Use `font-medium` as default weight, not `font-normal` (better legibility on dark backgrounds)

---

## 4. Spacing

Use the **4px / 8px grid** system. All spacing should be a multiple of 4.

| Context | Mobile | Desktop | Token |
|---------|--------|---------|-------|
| Card inner padding | 16px | 12px | `--space-card` |
| Compact card padding | 12px | 8px | `--space-card-sm` |
| Between sections | 24px | 16px | `--space-section` |
| Between cards | 12px | 8px | `gap-3` / `gap-2` |
| Between tappable items | 8px+ | 4px+ | `gap-2` minimum |
| Page horizontal padding | 16px | 24px | `px-4 lg:px-6` |

---

## 5. Icons

Always use **Lucide** icons. Size them with tokens:

| Context | Mobile | Desktop | Class |
|---------|--------|---------|-------|
| Inside buttons | 18px | 14px | `w-icon-sm h-icon-sm` |
| Navigation | 24px | 20px | `w-icon-lg h-icon-lg` |
| Inline with text | 16px | 14px | `w-4 h-4` or `w-icon-sm h-icon-sm` |
| Standalone icon buttons | 20px | 16px | `w-icon-md h-icon-md` inside `w-icon-btn h-icon-btn` |
| Status indicators | 14px | 12px | `w-3.5 h-3.5` |

